    "result": {"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Industry Context:</strong> Designed specifically for the FMCG and Food Processing sector to handle heavy-duty seed crushing and oil extraction processes.</li>\n<li><strong>Core Operation:</strong> Implemented comprehensive automated sequential control using Siemens S7-1200 PLC to ensure continuous material flow without manual intervention.</li>\n<li><strong>Motor Control:</strong> Integrated Multi-Brand VFDs to regulate the speed of large induction motors dynamically based on the load and processing stage.</li>\n<li><strong>Safety &#x26; Wiring:</strong> Developed robust relay logic and MCC panel interlocking to protect equipment from overload and ensure factory safety standards.</li>\n<li><strong>Associated With:</strong> Ulterior Engineering Ltd.</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Industrial Oil Mill Automation System","date":"2026-07-01","tech":["Siemens S7-1200 PLC","VFD Integration","Relay Logic","Induction Motor Control"],"github":"","external":"","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/ac5bf/oil-mill.png","srcSet":"/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/6b1e7/oil-mill.png 250w,\n/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/e5d44/oil-mill.png 500w,\n/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/ac5bf/oil-mill.png 1000w","sizes":"(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/ea46c/oil-mill.avif 250w,\n/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/569a0/oil-mill.avif 500w,\n/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/ea316/oil-mill.avif 1000w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/48571/oil-mill.webp 250w,\n/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/921bf/oil-mill.webp 500w,\n/static/32d68dc563ff5df0d1a4f2bc39558fcf/b7ef5/oil-mill.w